% ProDM — non-contrast COCA Agatston scoring with bridge-style progressive
% diffusion. Stanford COCA n=435; motion engine moves calcium points only;
% 30-case reader study. Their task-driven differentiable Agatston-surrogate
% loss is the inspiration for our lumen-geometry-aware loss.
% Verified 2026-04-29: arXiv ID, full author list, exact title, first author
% (Xinran Gong, Northwestern; senior author Bo Zhou).
